 SOLDER, RETRO, ORBIT, ...), plus HN Prime\n(the top 400), a music channel, and Late Night on ch 99, which only broadcasts\n11pm-5am your local time and shows color bars otherwise.<p>Similar to HackerTube it was built with Claude Code in a few hours.<p>All credit for the data goes to HackerTube. Happy to hear channel ideas.","title":"Show HN: HackerTV \u2013 HN's most-recommended Youtube videos as 24/7 TV channels","updated_at":"2026-11-04T14:49:24Z","url":"https://hackertv.org"},{"_highlightResult":{"author":{"matchLevel":"none","matchedWords":[],"value":"thatxliner"},"title":{"matchLevel":"none","matchedWords":[],"value":"C++26 Disapproved"},"url":{"matchLevel":"none","matchedWords":[],"value":"https://andreasfertig.com/blog/2026/11/cpp26-dis-failed-how-does-cpp-survive/"}},"_tags":["story","author_thatxliner","story_50360164","front_page"],"author":"thatxliner","children":[50361083,50361140,50361144,50361158,50361206,50361242,50361273,50361334,50361338,50361341,50361345,50361378,50361397,50361469,50361501,50361630,50361674,50361730,50361735,50361741,50361756,50361811,50361859,50361939,50362040,50362205,50362252,50362499,50362626,50362903,50363011,50363043,50363107,50363297,50363494,50363805,50364373,50364825],"created_at":"2026-11-04T00:33:22Z","created_at_i":1793752402,"num_comments":270,"objectID":"50360164","points":370,"story_id":50360164,"title":"C++26 Disapproved","updated_at":"2026-11-04T14:50:24Z","url":"https://andreasfertig.com/blog/2026/11/cpp26-dis-failed-how-does-cpp-survive/"},{"_highlightResult":{"author":{"matchLevel":"none","matchedWords":[],"value":"pseudolus"},"title":{"matchLevel":"none","matchedWords":[],"value":"AI is forcing us to pay off 40 years of technical debt"},"url":{"matchLevel":"none","matchedWords":[],"value":"https://spectrum.ieee.org/ai-in-cybersecurity-php2shell-vulnerability"}},"_tags":["story","author_pseudolus","story_50364336","front_page"],"author":"pseudolus","children":[50364517,50364523,50364549,50364550,50364555,503645